WEBVTT

00:08:00.415 --> 00:08:03.394
a extrémnych kontrastov,

00:08:05.654 --> 00:08:07.875
kde púšť zamŕza

00:08:08.775 --> 00:08:11.228
a voda vrie.

00:08:12.468 --> 00:08:15.038
Väčšmi než Zem pripomína Mars

00:08:15.038 --> 00:08:18.501
a pre život je rovnako nevľúdne.

00:08:26.506 --> 00:08:28.995
A samotné hviezdy –